u003e.%i\", which has no compression suffix. Log4j2\ntriggers archive compression solely via the filePattern suffix\n(.gz/.zip); compressionLevel only selects the level when such a suffix\nis present. As a result the configured compression never ran and, with\nwithFileIndex(\"nomax\"), audit archives accumulated uncompressed and\nunbounded -- filling the log directory (315 GB observed in production).\n\nAdd the .gz suffix so the already-configured BEST_COMPRESSION takes\neffect and each midnight rollover produces a gzip-compressed archive.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"03b3c7e8ee23e8ede54e85f7cb9ae735ed8c5ed9","tree_id":"6ffc130e21b1ae8820278e6538be33469b3b6adb","timestamp":"2026-09-28T12:02:03Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-co